<title>UK: Siebe up as SBC Warburg repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</title>
<headline>Siebe up as SBC Warburg repeats &quot;buy&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Siebe Plc set a record high on Friday as analysts at SBC Warburg repeated a &quot;buy&quot; rating after a meeting with executives from the company yesterday, market sources said.</p>
<p>Warburg analysts said the stock should be bought up to 11.00 stg, according to sources.</p>
<p>The stock was up 11p at 10.10-1/2 stg by 0939 GMT, extending a rally that has carried it up 15 percent since the end of July. Analysts at the brokerage were not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
